    "title": "Gospel Stream",
    "description": "Gospel Stream is the official app for all broadcasts from The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. When there\u2019s no broadcast live, browse a selection of videos and key messages created by the Church to uplift your day, support your Come, Follow Me lessons, and make viewing gospel messages easier.\u00a0\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Broadcasts, live events, and important messages from the Church\r\n\u2022 Browse and search for inspirational videos\r\n\u2022 Enjoy an ad free experience on broadcasts and on demand videos\r\n\u2022 Download videos for offline viewing\r\n\u2022 Notifications when broadcasts are about to start",
